## 2. TDD Test Suite (`backend/src/test/rsvp.test.ts`)

Created [`backend/src/test/rsvp.test.ts`](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Desktop/PROJECT%20CREATED/campushub/backend/src/test/rsvp.test.ts) covering 12 test specifications:
1. `RSVP-001`: Student RSVP creation and unique ticket generation (`PASS-xxxx-xxxx`).
2. `RSVP-002`: Idempotent duplicate RSVP returns existing confirmed ticket.
3. `RSVP-003`: Student RSVP cancellation sets status to `cancelled`.
4. `RSVP-004`: Multi-tenant isolation blocks cross-college RSVPs.
5. `RSVP-005`: Department visibility blocks unauthorized students from restricted department events.
6. `RSVP-006`: Past event RSVP rejection.
7. `RSVP-007`: Live attendee counts and `userRsvpd` flag in event listings and details.
8. `RSVP-008`: Student passbook listing (`GET /api/me/passes`).
9. `RSVP-009`: Admin / event creator attendee roster visibility (`GET /api/admin/events/:id/attendees`).
10. `RSVP-010`: Unauthenticated request blocking.
11. `RSVP-011`: Event capacity limit enforcement (returns `409 Conflict` when full).
12. `RSVP-012`: Capacity re-allocation when a spot opens up after cancellation.

