  - [`eventController.ts`](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Desktop/PROJECT%20CREATED/campushub/backend/src/controllers/eventController.ts): Added capacity validation and real-time attendee telemetry.
  - Mounted routes on [`eventRoutes.ts`](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Desktop/PROJECT%20CREATED/campushub/backend/src/routes/eventRoutes.ts), [`adminRoutes.ts`](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Desktop/PROJECT%20CREATED/campushub/backend/src/routes/adminRoutes.ts), and [`app.ts`](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Desktop/PROJECT%20CREATED/campushub/backend/src/app.ts).

